OL,3,ABurnham gets the early prison release
OL,4,Achanges he wanted - but at what cost?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister's announcement that
OL,7,Fhe will keep hundreds of criminals
OL,8,Fbehind bars who would otherwise have
OL,9,Fbeen released early is one he has
OL,10,Fwanted to make for weeks.
OL,12,FAndy Burnham had already expanded the
OL,13,Flist of people ineligible for early
OL,14,Frelease and had consistently said he
OL,15,Fwanted to go further.
OL,17,FWhat is not clear is exactly what has
OL,18,Fchanged to allow him to do so.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
