OL,3,AChurch leads tributes for man killed at
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man killed at a Christian festival
OL,7,Fin West Sussex on Friday has been named
OL,8,Fby his church as Robert Guanco, 41.
OL,10,FHe was a pastor at Jesus the Living
OL,11,FWater Church in Eastbourne, East
OL,12,FSussex.
OL,14,FSix other people were injured at the
OL,15,Fevent by a falling sign at the Big
OL,16,FChurch Festival, near Steyning, four of
OL,17,Fwhom were taken to hospital for
OL,18,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
